{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Biscudo</strong> is a strategic grid-based game where every move counts! Challenge your opponents in a battle of wits as you compete to claim the most squares by strategically drawing edges. With simple mechanics yet deep tactical gameplay, <strong>Biscudo</strong> offers an engaging experience for players of all skill levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to Play:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take turns</strong> drawing unclaimed edges on the board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Complete a square</strong> by drawing its last remaining edge to claim it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Powerups!</strong>\u00a0Special squares to spice up the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chain your moves\u00a0</strong>\u2014 if you complete two squares at once, you earn an extra turn!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Outsmart your opponent</strong> by setting up combos while avoiding giving them easy claims.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Win the game</strong> by claiming the most squares when the board is full.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 Compete against AI or challenge a friend in a local match (online is coming soon)<br>\u2714 Clean, intuitive visuals for a seamless experience<br>\u2714 Perfect for quick matches or deep strategic play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you have what it takes to dominate the board?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1770570?t=1743709074","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1770570?t=1743709074","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1770570/8d33a8c86123f3c09ed7ce98ad32df3184f05efa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743709074","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.